  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\n1. ÷ and ×\n\n49 + 16 × 7 - __**36 ÷ 16**__ = 92\n\n⇒ 49 + __**16 **____**×**____** 7**__ - 2.25 = 92\n\n⇒ __**49 + 112**____** **__- 2.25 = 92\n\n⇒ __**161 - 2.25**__ = 92\n\n⇒ 158.75 ≠ 92\n\n2. + and -\n\n49 - __**16 ÷ 7**__ + 36 × 16 = 92\n\n⇒ 49 - 2.28 + __**36 × 16**__ = 92\n\n⇒ __**49**__ - 2.28 __**+ 576**__ = 92\n\n⇒ __**625 - 2.28**__ = 92\n\n⇒ 622.72 ≠ 92\n\n3. ÷ and +\n\n__**49 ÷ 16**__ + 7 - 36 × 16 = 92\n\n⇒ 3.0625 + 7 - __**36 × 16**__ = 92\n\n⇒ __**3.0625**____** + 7**__ - 576 = 92\n\n⇒ __**10.0625**____** - 576**__ = 92\n\n⇒ -565.9375 ≠ 92\n\n4. × and +\n\n49 × __**16 ÷ 7**__ - 36 + 16 = 92\n\n⇒ __**49 ×**____** **__**__2.28__** - 36 + 16 = 92\n\n⇒ **__112__** - 36 __**+**____** 16**__ = 92\n\n⇒ 128 - 36 = 92\n\n⇒ 92 = 92\n\nHence, ‘**× and +**’ is the correct answer.",
